  "geometryBasis": "The site, containment envelope, turbine hall and blocks are independently mapped. The facility operator gives a 257 m transverse span, 165 m length and 110 m height for the arch above its foundation. The neighboring tall block and long roof are simplified from the mapped building envelopes.",
